      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The onset of ventricular tachycardia was examined in 44 patients with various types of heart disease. In only six patients (14%) the ventricular tachycardia was initiated by an ectopic ventricular complex interrupting the T wave. The findiings suggest that the importance of R on T phenomenon may have been over-emphasized."},
